flowchart LR
    G["gshop<br/>(React / TypeScript)"]

    subgraph services["Gluon services"]
        CAT["catalog-service"]
        CART["cart-service"]
        O["order-service"]
        I["inventory-service"]
        P["payment-service"]
        F["fulfilment-service"]
        N["notification-service"]
        U["user-service"]
    end

    subgraph stores["Stores"]
        CATDB[("catalog Postgres<br/>+ Redis cache")]
        CARTDB[("cart Redis<br/>(primary)")]
        ODB[("order Postgres<br/>+ Redis cache")]
        IDB[("inventory Postgres<br/>(ledger)")]
        PDB[("payment Postgres<br/>(UNIQUE order_id)")]
        FDB[("fulfilment Postgres")]
        UDB[("user Postgres")]
    end

    K[("Kafka event bus")]
    SWEEP["US-20 expiry sweep<br/>(built)"]

    G -->|"browse"| CAT
    G -->|"cart"| CART
    G -->|"auth"| U
    G -->|"orders"| O
    G -->|"payment methods"| P
    G -->|"admin stock"| I
    G -->|"fulfilment queue"| F
    O -->|"bulk reserve / release"| I
    O -->|"authorize"| P
    F -->|"order snapshot"| O

    CAT --- CATDB
    CART --- CARTDB
    O --- ODB
    I --- IDB
    P --- PDB
    F --- FDB
    U --- UDB

    O -->|"order-events"| K
    P -->|"payment-events"| K
    F -->|"fulfilment-events"| K
    U -->|"user-events"| K
    K -->|"consumes<br/>(fan-out in kafka diagram)"| N
    SWEEP -->|"PaymentAuthorizationExpired"| K

    NOTE["All edges shown are built.<br/>Event types and the full consumer fan-out are in kafka-domain-topology.svg.<br/>inventory-service publishes nothing and has no event topic (TD-22).<br/>Checkout failures create no order row and publish nothing (ADR 0018).<br/>Capture PaymentFailed writes order_reconciliation and does not release inventory;<br/>DispatchFailed releases inventory. Dispatch outcomes are not mirrored into order-events.<br/>OrderCancelled (US-9) fans out to payment (void), inventory (release), fulfilment (abort) and notification."]

